Legal finance human review checkpoints
title end

paragraph start
A person reads every AI output about law, tax or money before it is used and checks it against an official source. A qualified professional confirms anything that could cost money or create a duty.
paragraph end

paragraph start
An output without a source is not used.
paragraph end
